{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-07-22 18:45:00', 'title': 'MP MATERIALS SET TO JOIN S&P MIDCAP 400', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JULY 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MP MATERIALS CORP. (NYSE:MP) WILL REPLACE SANDERSON FARMS INC. (NASD:SAFM) IN THE S&P MIDCAP 400 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON WEDNESDAY, JULY 27. CARGILL AND CONTINENTAL GRAIN ACQUIRED SANDERSON FARMS IN A DEAL THAT CLOSED TODAY.'}